	set_cmt	(0X227B4,	"Sets (ORs in) bit ax of the WORLD.DAT-backed cell-monster-spawned bitmap (record type 0xA) and writes it back. Called from SpawnMonsterInFacingDirection with ax=the spawned monster's own cell index ([si]). Sibling of ClearCellMonsterSpawnedFlag/TestCellMonsterSpawnedFlag.",	0);
