	set_cmt	(0X299BC,	"HandleGameCommand's unlock-door handler (word_32974 in 0x21-0x2E or ==0x2F). Uses ProbeFacingTile to find what's ahead; if it's a lock-type object, loads its state via LoadLockState/LoadCurgameRecord. Shows 'NOT LOCKED' directly if the already-unlocked bit is set (same test as ShowLockStatus). Otherwise compares the door's required-key flags (word_32DCE) against the player's held key (word_36C81/word_2E548) to resolve the unlock attempt.",	0);
