	set_cmt	(0X2A8B5,	"Looks up al's high nibble (hue group) in a 16-entry stack table ([bp-0x4A]); no match leaves al unchanged; a match with low byte 0x0F forces al=0xFF (hue-group-wide transparency); otherwise replaces just the hue-group nibble, keeping the shade nibble -- a per-hue-group color remap/mask, plausibly for status-effect tinting. Called from DrawPicture.",	0);
