	set_cmt	(0X2D93D,	"Resolves base damage (TryResolveAttackAgainstTarget, or a direct word_332E8/[di+0x5A]/2 path), filters it through ApplyTargetResistancesToAttack, then -- if any damage or status flags survived -- commits to the target: [di+0xC]|=3, [di+0x10]-=damage, ORs surviving status flags into [di+0xC] (and [di+0x96] if word_33300 bit 0x200), overwrites [di+0x1C]/[di+0x1E] with word_332EE/word_332FC, and conditionally clears [di+0xC] bit 0. Called twice from sub_2C0FE.",	0);
